<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Works with Third eye</Major>
    <Description>This is a part of my series called Third Eye.

So this will bag HQ weed, by activating the third eye and clicking on HQ option.

This has been made so it repeats over and over.

You can adjust the time between it repeats by changing in the script, bc the time it takes to finish bagging differs from each server.

Resolution is 1920x1080
You will probably need to have the driver installed.

I will have more third eye scripts out as time goes by.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 226 1
Delay 500 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 64 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 64
MoveTo 1004 539
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 226 1
Delay 50 ms
MoveTo 1354 471
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 11000 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Fivem</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>